 "strings": {
  "That's nonsense.　": "",
  "But... There's only one detective here.": "",
  "So let's start the interrogation.": "",
  "Let's start...\nwith the cabaret and what you were doing there.": "",
  "Why were you at that cabaret tonight?": "",
  "I know that you're the Mole.": "",
  "You're the Mole.": "",
  "I'm the one asking\nthe questions around here, so...": "",
  "I'm the one asking the questions here.": "",
  "You aren't denying it.": "",
  "You going to deny it?": "",
  "Why don't you start by telling me what you\nwere doing when you first noticed the fire.": "",
  "When you noticed the fire...\nWhat were you doing?": "",
  "Hamura getting away is what's gonna bring you down\nfor good. You really missed your big chance.": "",
  "You couldn't pull off silencing Hamura.\nYou messed up big time.": "",
  "Can you tell me who started\nthe fire, at least?": "",
  "Do you know who started the fire?": "",
  "Matsugane-san is dead because of you.": "",
  "You killed Matsugane-san.": "",
  "So the moment I get out,\nyour ass is mine!": "",
  "You're not gonna get away with it!": "",
  "Let's see you try!": "",
  "Nor will you!": "",
  "I don't think you realize...\nAD-9 gives me complete immunity.": "",
  "The powers behind AD-9 have\nan interest in protecting me.": "",
  "I'm talking about people that go\nall the way up the chain here.": "",
  "They have eyes and ears everywhere.": "",
  "They see everything.": "",
  "It's possible...": "",
  "When it comes to protecting AD-9's interests...\nthere's no limit to what they'll do.": "",
  "...That they've even got support\nfrom police higher-ups.": "",
  "Hamura is a loose end that\nI'll take care of eventually.": "",
  "It's only a matter of time\nuntil Hamura is silenced.": "",
  "And that's a fate you'll both share.": "",
  "So unfortunately for you...": "",
  "This won't end with you alive.": "",
  "You won't escape either.": "",
  "I don't mind that. All that matters\nis proving that you murdered them!": "",
  "Before that happens, I'm going to\nrip off your mask and reveal everything.": "",
  "If you think you scare me... sorry. \nYou has-been fraud.": "",
  "Don't get too excited,\nyou ex-lawyer fraud.": "",
  "Kuroiwa-san?\nThere's a call for you.": "",
  "Kuroiwa-san. Call for you.": "",
  "Just one second.": "",
  "Should I take over?": "",
  "Want me to take over?": "",
  "Nah.": "",
  "I'm through here.": "",
  "I think we're through here.": "",
  "The fire at the cabaret...": "",
  "That fire at the cabaret tonight...": "",
  "Tojo Clan and Kyorei Clan yakuza\nare both responsible for starting it.": "",
  "Just more Tojo Clan versus\nKyorei Clan hostility.": "",
  "Luckily, Yagami-san just happened to be\nnearby and saw the whole thing.": "",
  "Yagami-san here was just lucky\nto be there at the time.": "",
  "This case is closed.\nThank you for your time.": "",
  "Thank you for your cooperation.": "",
  "I'll escort you out then, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Come on, I'll see you out.": "",
  "This won't end...": "",
  "I told Shono...　": "",
  "I just confronted Shono the other day.\nSaid I was onto his insane tests.": "",
  "...That I knew about all\nhis little experiments.": "",
  "And now... there's a new body\nlike nothing's changed at all.": "",
  "And yet, another corpse\nturns up like nothing happened.": "",
  "I can only see one way\nthis shakes out.": "",
  "Do you know what this means?": "",
  "There's gonna be more deaths\nbefore this is all over.": "",
  "It means he's just\ngonna keep doing it.": "",
  "Even when he's this close to being all but caught...\nhe's not gonna stop for anything.": "",
  "No matter how close I get\nto the truth, he won't stop.": "",
  "There's no doubt now.": "",
  "He's not gonna flinch.": "",
  "So now?": "",
  "That's...": "",
  "Shono, he... He seems like this quiet,\nharmless scientist when you see him on the job. ": "",
  "Shono's just a quiet,\nearnest scientist on the surface.": "",
  "Except... AD-9 changes who he is.": "",
  "But when it comes to AD-9...": "",
  "Makes the guy a monster.": "",
  "...He's a raging demon.": "",
  "Completing his drug will save millions. Not to mention\ntheir families. It would change the whole world.": "",
  "If he completes his formula,\nmillions might be saved. Their families too.": "",
  "With all that power protecting Dr. Shono,\nhe'd risk everything he has.": "",
  "He'd become unstoppable.\nAnd that's what he wants.": "",
  "It's us... against anyone that money can buy.": "",
  "I've got enemies everywhere I look.": "",
  "What are you going to do?": "",
  "What are you going to do, then!?": "",
  "Why not walk away?": "",
  "Give up?": "",
  "Wish I could...": "",
  "No way.　": "",
  "Matsugane-san's death\ncan't go unanswered.": "",
  "They killed a man\nwho was like a father to me.": "",
  "He deserves closure.": "",
  "And you know what?": "",
  "They won't get away with this.": "",
  "They're going to pay.": "",
  "They held his funeral\nat Tojo Clan headquarters.": "",
  "It was... an intimate service.": "",
  "The Matsugane Family would've passed to Hamura,\nbut with him missing, it was all but dissolved.": "",
  "The Matsugane Family would pass to Hamura,\nbut with him missing, it was all but dissolved.": "",
  "And on top of that...": "",
  "It wasn't like he'd made much of an impact\non the Tojo brass to begin with.": "",
  "He'd never made an impact\nthat the brass would have noticed.": "",
  "But to Genda-sensei,\nhe was an old friend of over forty years.": "",
  "And then there was Kaito-san, who joined up\nafter finishing middle school.": "",
  "And Kaito-san had joined up\nafter finishing middle school.": "",
  "And Higashi, too. When Kaito got expelled,\nprotecting the boss became his personal mission.": "",
  "And when Kaito got expelled,\nHigashi made protecting his boss a personal mission.": "",
  "All of us knew exactly who was\nresponsible for taking him from us.": "",
  "And we all knew exactly who was\nresponsible for taking him from us.": "",
  "It was just a matter of finding the proof.": "",
  "It's just a matter of finding\nthe proof to bring them down.": "",
  "I have some concerns about AD-9.\nAt the moment, it's only effective on mice.": "",
  "As it stands,\nAD-9 has only been effective on mice.": "",
  "I'm well aware of that, yes.": "",
  "I'm well aware of that.": "",
  "But I'm confident it will\nwork on humans, too. ": "",
  "But I'm sure it's going\nto work on people too.": "",
  "No. I'm afraid you're mistaken.": "",
  "No. I'm afraid it won't.": "",
  "What's this now?\nWe just had a fantastic conference.": "",
  "What's you problem?\nWe just had a fantastic press conference.": "",
  "This is no time for doom and gloom.": "",
  "Can't you give it a rest for one day?": "",
  "Just sit back and try to relax.\nYou deserve it.": "",
  "Learn to read the room a little.\nGet your head out of the work.": "",
  "Oh, and by the way.\nIchinose was thrilled with what he saw.": "",
  "Even Vice Minister Ichinose\nwas pleased today.": "",
  "One day we're almost getting shut down,\nthe next we have a massive budget.": "",
  "We went from being on the brink\nof a shutdown to having a blank check.": "",
  "And if you can make consistent progress...\nAD-9 will head to clinical—": "",
  "Once you've finished the testing\nand the drug is complete—": "",
  "At this stage, I'm afraid clinical trials\nwould be inadvisable. If we try...": "",
  "If we start clinical tests\nwith AD-9 in its current state...": "",
  "All the test subjects will die.": "",
  "The subjects are going to die.": "",
  "Are you sure!?": "",
  "What!?　": "",
  "How can you say that\nwith such confidence!? Huh!?": "",
  "How can you say that\nwith such certainty!? ": "",
  "Shinpei Okubo was actually innocent.": "",
  "Shinpei Okubo was innocent!": "",
  "What? Innocent?\nWhy are you bringing this up now?": "",
  "Huh? Where did that come from?": "",
  "The court ruled correctly. Waku-san...\nHis murder didn't play out like you think it did.": "",
  "The ruling was right.\nHe didn't kill our patient.": "",
  "The real cause of death...": "",
  "What actually killed him...": "",
  "...Was none other than AD-9.": "",
  "...Was AD-9.": "",
  "That murder was...": "",
  "That whole thing...　": "",
  "It was a secret clinical trial for AD-9.": "",
  "...Was AD-9's first human subject.": "",
  "I gave him the injection...\nPersonally.": "",
  "And I'm the one who injected it.": "",
  "You did what!?": "",
  "What are you saying!?": "",
  "Please, I...": "",
  "I just...": "",
  "I had to take this opportunity.\nThe whole world is waiting for this cure.": "",
  "I wanted to give the world what\nthey've been waiting so patiently for...": "",
  "But when I injected him...\nHe let out the most horrible scream.": "",
  "The moment I injected him,\nhe started screaming in pain...": "",
  "These hands... covered his mouth.\nI tried to make him shut up.": "",
  "I put my hands over his\nmouth to quiet him down...": "",
  "Which means you...\nYou're a murderer.": "",
  "You're saying... You really...": "",
  "How could you be such a damn fool!?": "",
  "How could you do\nsomething so foolish!?　": "",
  "What are we going to do!?": "",
  "And what now!?": "",
  "Shono. I just spent the entire afternoon\ntalking up your drug to the press.": "",
  "We just sang AD-9's virtues\nto a room full of press!": "",
  "With my goddamn name on the research!": "",
  "And my name's attached to it!": "",
  "If you hadn't held that press conference,\nthe ADDC would have been done for and you—": "",
  "And without the conference,\nthe ADDC would have been shut down.": "",
  "Why didn't you tell me this before!?": "",
  "Why didn't you tell me this beforehand!?": "",
  "I needed you, Dr. Kido.": "",
  "If I had, would you have stayed?": "",
  "I couldn't let the Center get shut down.": "",
  "Again, no conference, no Center.": "",
  "The AD-9 project would have\nbeen terminated.": "",
  "A lifesaving drug would\nbe shelved indefinitely. ": "",
  "But I've...": "",
  "This has been my entire life's work.\nEnsuring that AD-9 would save the world.": "",
  "I've dedicated my entire life\nto AD-9's development!": "",
  "This whole thing is preposterous.": "",
  "That's not my problem...": "",
  "I'm going to the press!": "",
  "I'm going to resign!": "",
  "There's no need for that.": "",
  "You don't need to worry.": "",
  "Don't you understand, Director?": "",
  "I need your cooperation, Dr. Kido.": "",
  "As long as we finish AD-9's development,\nthere won't be any issues.": "",
  "As long as I complete AD-9,\neverything will be fine.": "",
  "Your name will go down in history\nas the man who saved the world.": "",
  "And when I do,\nyou'll go down in history as its creator...": "",
  "Not to mention, the money.": "",
  "And you'll be beyond rich.": "",
  "But if you really insist\non revealing the truth...": "",
  "But if you reveal the truth now...": "",
  "Both of our careers\nwould go down the drain.": "",
  "Our careers are as good as finished.": "",
  "And you have more to lose...": "",
  "Between the two of us...": "",
  "Director.": "",
  "You have more to lose.": "",
  "Shono...": "",
  "Shono...　": "",
  "You're mad.": "",
  "End of the line.": "",
  "Is this...": "",
  "The hell is this?": "",
  "What is this place?": "",
  "This is it.\nThis has to be Shono's secret lab.": "",
  "This is... Shono's secret lab.": "",
  "You two? What're you...": "",
  "Wh-Why are you here?": "",
  "Huh, didn't think I'd find you\nworking at the scene of the crime.": "",
  "I didn't expect to run right into you.": "",
  "Guess our timing's pretty good.": "",
  "You've got good timing.": "",
  "Sugiura.": "",
  "Get some video of this place.": "",
  "Mmhm.": "",
  "Stop that!": "",
  "So all those yakuza who got their\neyes gouged out. You did it here, huh?": "",
  "This where the people with their\neyes gouged out were brought.": "",
  "Can't wait to see what turns up.\nThe cops are gonna have a field day in this place. ": "",
  "The police are going to\nhave field day in here.": "",
  "The victim's fingerprints. Hair.\nBodily fluids. DNA.": "",
  "Victims' fingerprints, hair,\nbodily fluids, DNA...": "",
  "Can you imagine just how long I've been waiting\nto see evidence like this come to light?": "",
  "I just hit the evidence jackpot\nI've been so desperate to find.": "",
  "I, uh... I don't know what you're...": "",
  "Wh-What are you talking about?": "",
  "Sugiura? What's wrong?": "",
  "Sugiura, what's up?": "",
  "I'm sorry... Yagami-san.": "",
  "I'm sorry, Yagami-san.": "",
  "I've been lying to you about\neverything all along... Until now.": "",
  "I've been lying to everyone\nfor a while now.": "",
  "What do you mean by that?": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
